name: sim.addLog
description: Adds a log message that will be output in the console or status bar
luaSynopsis: sim.addLog(int verbosity, string message)
pythonSynopsis: sim.addLog(int verbosity, string message)
inputs:
1. verbosity: the verbosity level. Most appropriate values are sim.verbosity_scripterrors (for errors), sim.verbosity_scriptwarnings (for warning) and sim.verbosity_scriptinfos. Combine with sim.verbosity_undecorated if you wish to output the naked message. sim.verbosity_scripterrors will additionaly raise an error.
2. message: the message. None/nil clears the status bar
outputs:
